{"id":1846757,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-26T20:32:31.195Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/fKiTn0XxUFoGIEdWAbURc7CVvYM.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1846757,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Raise the Bar","overview":"While the road running world debated whether women belonged at the start line, Western States was already sending them deep into the Sierra Nevadas. In the decades since, women have closed the performance gap and transformed the sport.  Now, a new generation arrives to push it further. The film follows four women chasing radically different stakes. A Chinese pro toes the line after placing second at WSER the year before, determined to claim a historic win for her nation. A Hong Kong-based mother of two leaves her family behind to train, doubling down on the sacrifices required at the highest level. A former pro triathlete returns to the 100-mile distance, testing her limits in a fleeting athletic window. And a new ultrarunner battles nerves as she fights to finish this iconic race.  With records, careers, and confidence on the line, Raise the Bar is a love letter to the world’s oldest 100-mile trail race, the women who shaped it, and those pushing the limits of what's possible.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/f6Wrpms3ZJRMnxxRGUTV0uJ3HtF.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":309859,"logo_path":null,"name":"HOKA","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":86,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Raise the Bar","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6698839,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Heather Jackson","original_name":"Heather Jackson","popularity":0,"profile_path":"/hbUf8Hc7fM38FNLkvfqzSoq1Ruu.jpg","cast_id":25,"character":"2025 WSER Participant","credit_id":"6b07f7c020